   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **New Britain**: back after 224 archived shows (3721 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Bones Don’t Rust**: back after 70 archived shows (902 days); rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Broken to Begin With**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Moon Over Goldsboro**: back after 100 archived shows (1194 days) [3]\n- **Sax Rohmer #1**: back after 102 archived shows (1197 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2025-08-09.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 49 min [1]\n- **tmg2025-08-09.ATPro37.heyman**: source not stated; 12 songs; 51 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children [1]\n- The show was night two of Guster's On The Ocean Festival [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2025-08-09.flac24**: taped by dgodwin; source: Source: Beyerdynamic MC740 (Hyper) -> Tascam DR100mk iii [1]\n- **tmg2025-08-09.ATPro37.heyman**: taped by Dennis Heyman; transferred by Dennis Heyman [2]. Also: Recorded with an AT Pro 37 microphone into a Zoom F3, saved as 32-bit/96k WAV, edited in Audacity 3.7.5, and converted to 24/48 FLAC; The microphone was placed dead center at the front of the house tent [2]",
